                         sco-u:SCO_0000001 ;
         rdfs:comment "A time-bounded undertaking with a defined start and end, unfolding through a sequence of activities. Projects are modelled as gufo:Event subclasses because they are occurrents with temporal parts. This follows the UFO treatment of plans versus their execution, distinguishing between the project description (a plan) and the project itself (the actual undertaking)."@en ;
         rdfs:label "Project"@en .


